  P0@cta 0,gpu 0           | P1@cta 0,gpu 0          | P2@cta 1,gpu 0          | P3@cta 1,gpu 0          | P4@cta 0,gpu 1          | P5@cta 0,gpu 1          | P6@cta 1,gpu 1          | P7@cta 1,gpu 1          ; 
  st.weak x, 550           |                         |                         |                         |                         |                         |                         |                         ; 
